    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d117">

                <pb facs="0252" n="86" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg86"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.001 F35/–</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chinese Minister to the Acting Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 51</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chinese Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-07-12">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 12, 1917</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I am instructed by my Government to
                    communicate to you the following proclamation of the President of the Republic
                    of China: <pb facs="0253" n="87" xml:id="pg87"/>
                    <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Whereas President Li Yuan Hung is unable, for cause, to perform the
                            duties of his office;</p>
                        <p>Now, therefore, I, Feng Kuo-Chang, do hereby proclaim to all whom it may
                            concern that in pursuance of Article 5, Section 2, of the Presidential
                            Election Law, I have, on this 6th day of the 7th month (July 6, 1917),
                            respectfully taken up the duties of the office of the President of the
                            Republic.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>Accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">V. K. Wellington Koo</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
